# Text Preprocessing using Python

## overview
the notebook cleans raw text and prepares it for machine learning and text analysis tasks.

---

## features

- Convert text to lowercase
- Remove punctuation
- Tokenization
- Stop word removal
- Lemmatization
- display cleaned text

---

## Technologies Used

- Python
- Jupyter Notebook
- NLTK

